    <p>LG linear-drive direct-drive units have a built-in diagnostic mode (button-press sequence on power-up). We use it on every LG service call. Deep dive: <a href="/services/washer-repair/lg-error-codes/">LG washer error codes</a> (CL vs LE vs tCL). Brand pillar: <a href="/brands/lg-washer-repair/">LG washer repair</a>.</p>
