        <tr><td>Too many suds</td><td>Suds</td><td>Non-HE detergent on HE machine (customer-side)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><strong>Note:</strong> E10 / E20 / E40 / E60 are Electrolux and Frigidaire codes, not GE — many charts mislabel them (the correctly-labeled table is in the Frigidaire / Electrolux section below). Full detail: <a href="/services/washer-repair/ge-error-codes/">GE washer error codes</a>. Brand pillar: <a href="/brands/ge-washer-repair/">GE washer repair</a>.</p>
